      en: ["Home to over 4,000 manufacturing units in the automotive sector.", "Accounts for nearly 20% of India's total automobile production.", "Mercedes-Benz established its high-tech Chakan plant in 2009.", "Tata Motors (then TELCO) commenced operations in Pune in 1966.", "The Chakan-Talegaon belt is one of Asia's largest industrial corridors.", "Leading center for R&D in electric vehicle (EV) technology."],
