      en: ["The project has a total installed capacity of 3,960 MW.", "It features six identical supercritical power units of 660 MW each.", "The plant is powered by its own captive coal mines (Moher and Moher-Amlohri).", "It supplies reliable and low-cost electricity to seven Indian states.", "The facility was developed by Reliance Power under the UMPP scheme.", "Sasan has consistently been ranked as the best-performing thermal plant in India."],
